📌 Key Takeaways
Supply-demand imbalance is a primary operational challenge
Driver behavior significantly impacts ride completion rates
Revenue is driven more by ride volume than premium pricing
Ratings provide limited actionable insight due to compression
Data quality improvements are essential for deeper analysis
